<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Toll Bros raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Toll Bros raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it upgraded Toll Brothers Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Said stock was upgraded on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Toll Brothers gained 7/8 to 21-1/4.</p>
</text>
